    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hentai Mei</i> is an intriguing puzzle game where the player gradually assembles images of the maid Mei, divided into pieces, with each level increasing in difficulty. The game consists of thirty levels, and at each one, the image is broken into parts that need to be put together to reveal the full picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161190/extras/Gif-Mei.gif?t=1755420891\" /></span>Features of the game: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30 levels;<br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30 achievements;<br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mode &quot;GOD&quot;\u2764\ufe0f;<br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Difficulty levels;<br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxing and romantic music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161190/extras/51d7639af1423d76e66943082c58cfaf.poster.avif?t=1755420891\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161190/extras/51d7639af1423d76e66943082c58cfaf.webm?t=1755420891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161190/extras/51d7639af1423d76e66943082c58cfaf.mp4?t=1755420891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Step by step, as the player completes each image, they uncover new parts of Mei\u2019s story, immersing themselves in her atmosphere and background. The game also includes a &quot;GOD&quot; mode \u2014 try it out if you need a break from assembling puzzles.</p>",
